{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:26:10Z","created_by_operation":"op_42f8b51d9c4943029c62e10d087e8171","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_22bd14b15df8dbd9ebc8176eeff6373582dca5b86d068bd7e400e26849491547","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"openbmb/chatdev@4fb2db0ea903 snapshot 73ccffc33d7b49cd","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_4114fe5d66f47a999b679aab883593d56c3784e5b648767cfd1ad428d4e591f5","slc_448d1f0b024f1a659107d62cf2d2ece5a701ed594d4a4b57c5561a5b9015a127","slc_63cb7eff11977647f4cf92738974bc74f260554923c59c386db52fa52f1cccc5","slc_c823207207db461563a07f63cb0610a36e0e53452cfd4b0472ef92a03e29fe7a","slc_d12145145e860bdb97d8acad8025eff3e38712653c4083ff659d823bcc4c8f18"],"source_ids":["src_3b39b0d1596e5140812e4c2dc62fa26e"],"text":"The backend exposes REST endpoints for uploading and listing session attachments (POST/GET /api/uploads/{session_id}), artifact-event polling, per-artifact download with meta/stream modes, and a whole-session zip download, with WebSocket mirrors emitting artifact_created events.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:26:10Z","updated_by_operation":"op_42f8b51d9c4943029c62e10d087e8171"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:26:10Z","created_by_operation":"op_42f8b51d9c4943029c62e10d087e8171","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_267909084b2727ecf4b3a5f6b655ea8f8055cb5846f1bbd5803217272c34fbf3","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"openbmb/chatdev@4fb2db0ea903 snapshot 73ccffc33d7b49cd","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0812c020d389350299b61f6add572cfd64b3c574fb8fa0dbb571266a0b575f02","slc_7f557d421040836bb3bf34ce26cf309294d7b2d2315759441a77fd77d68a96fe","slc_a1b18c3f27f1ec9a28510fde90b5f363cf556558f54ddb4c84825fa51114f373","slc_f020bb55b5a20e57a4b118678aef87d252beeb596691c9b7e7ef209c027b11ea"],"source_ids":["src_0656200055b95265931bfe038a70db9b"],"text":"A Python SDK exposes run_workflow (from runtime.sdk) taking a YAML file, task prompt, attachments, and variable overrides, returning a result with a final message; it is also published on PyPI as chatdev 0.1.0.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:26:10Z","updated_by_operation":"op_42f8b51d9c4943029c62e10d087e8171"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:26:10Z","created_by_operation":"op_42f8b51d9c4943029c62e10d087e8171","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_2ffa16cbf093b932782b37191564262314acb9ccd74b5c51171327494dd7d1ba","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"openbmb/chatdev@4fb2db0ea903 snapshot 73ccffc33d7b49cd","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_7c79f7fd54ea9bc731b802023b991d6e8074ac323e5eddfeb4a4c5698e72de9f"],"source_ids":["src_0656200055b95265931bfe038a70db9b"],"text":"The project is modular: server/ hosts the FastAPI backend, runtime/ handles agent abstraction and tool execution, workflow/ contains multi-agent logic driven by entity/ configs, frontend/ is a Vue 3 web console, and functions/ holds custom Python tools.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:26:10Z","updated_by_operation":"op_42f8b51d9c4943029c62e10d087e8171"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:26:10Z","created_by_operation":"op_42f8b51d9c4943029c62e10d087e8171","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_4b0c04c68b0b3663363980086499526722e0b608797c34729b7dcd0b62314c27","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"openbmb/chatdev@4fb2db0ea903 snapshot 73ccffc33d7b49cd","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1041259946e66186ec08fd6860a9559f2c79442d43d47bce4f73e9babfdd8811","slc_84d6e3ff21f1fd93181be42f6e593c8ccb052a2d9396b26a79de5d6687f04e65","slc_e61683a0a23e35234851d1bbb26716311861050b794ac4415e6929b60585b1a9"],"source_ids":["src_daa8306a64875810a02f47980fdc9366"],"text":"Agent nodes attach memories via MemoryAttachmentConfig with fields for store name, retrieve_stage, top_k (default 3), similarity_threshold, and read/write flags; retrieved items are injected into the agent context and writes occur after node completion.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:26:10Z","updated_by_operation":"op_42f8b51d9c4943029c62e10d087e8171"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:26:10Z","created_by_operation":"op_42f8b51d9c4943029c62e10d087e8171","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_563418ec0285f29a25a49e207e04deb499f4416b56c9d1a38e968891fe508b39","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"openbmb/chatdev@4fb2db0ea903 snapshot 73ccffc33d7b49cd","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_88597f1b8647bb2cb5fa4d0637e7af0d5054ff7aa9508e5091e230d44cae6fff","slc_9068ac3f6fb133b1eec923034205ace480317f10cce368972dfe535385452263","slc_cb927beb7c58a57020569b2e2d1e197113f28d826786ce4247bc4cf43a5104a2"],"source_ids":["src_0656200055b95265931bfe038a70db9b"],"text":"Prerequisites are macOS/Linux/WSL/Windows, Python 3.12+, Node.js 18+, and the uv package manager; Python dependencies are synced with uv sync and frontend dependencies with npm install.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:26:10Z","updated_by_operation":"op_42f8b51d9c4943029c62e10d087e8171"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:26:10Z","created_by_operation":"op_42f8b51d9c4943029c62e10d087e8171","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_65d83930604d5d2125e877ac5333874b17ed6a6c1171b977ac64ac067dae2941","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=relevance","setting":"openbmb/chatdev@4fb2db0ea903 snapshot 73ccffc33d7b49cd","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_44cdbbafb0a0a70a8a8f8da1f27051d7d295bdeb4bd1a7dd8558b8308f71ea38","slc_53619925a1381e34a58487372112e6af8249f7c327aae382a7b941c9d1dec4c2"],"source_ids":["src_0656200055b95265931bfe038a70db9b"],"text":"Out-of-the-box YAML workflow templates ship in yaml_instance/, covering data visualization, Blender-based 3D generation, game development, deep research, and teaching-video scenarios.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:26:10Z","updated_by_operation":"op_42f8b51d9c4943029c62e10d087e8171"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:26:10Z","created_by_operation":"op_42f8b51d9c4943029c62e10d087e8171","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_7743aebec48fc5047881a063b8487fe6e227b507c1366ec778bfa6e9c13272a2","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"openbmb/chatdev@4fb2db0ea903 snapshot 73ccffc33d7b49cd","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_760dad545e5f87a802862b4453b1353a28154c7969b11606303153081f55c535","slc_7b0a99f2d238499142610307bdb19ba2262c75bfd7406149245cf9a8d1f15387","slc_ab53540c3b4fc021b627803badfc41ddea3e410c336c68739b1f3824ac80e54c"],"source_ids":["src_0656200055b95265931bfe038a70db9b"],"text":"The application can be started with make dev, or manually via uv run python server_main.py --port 6400 for the backend and a frontend dev server on port 5173 with VITE_API_BASE_URL pointing at the backend.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:26:10Z","updated_by_operation":"op_42f8b51d9c4943029c62e10d087e8171"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:26:10Z","created_by_operation":"op_42f8b51d9c4943029c62e10d087e8171","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_a699ba226554947ccf84644cbaf2b34b2b7d08329a9439ff670f6cd86989670f","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"openbmb/chatdev@4fb2db0ea903 snapshot 73ccffc33d7b49cd","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_31213c12e4b1a3ae4378668c6f2f72fe381f1717272765acf1f2479792c4fb1a","slc_5f46e585c153a061b67615ad385ac2645d8cb0f96406af0f28818839b1fb605d"],"source_ids":["src_0656200055b95265931bfe038a70db9b"],"text":"The web console includes a visual drag-and-drop workflow canvas for configuring node parameters and context flows, plus a Launch tab to run workflows, watch real-time logs, inspect artifacts, and give human-in-the-loop feedback.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:26:10Z","updated_by_operation":"op_42f8b51d9c4943029c62e10d087e8171"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:26:10Z","created_by_operation":"op_42f8b51d9c4943029c62e10d087e8171","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_b436a660288c396288fbd47e94f772cdd08e2eb1d3104f4684ac14685c15d8f7","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=specifications","setting":"openbmb/chatdev@4fb2db0ea903 snapshot 73ccffc33d7b49cd","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_14cb47c8569e963645a1b12f12b0b4a0ee4c46dc2c2a47d1ae180d5b9bce36dc","slc_b2d3a554cff67e19158f6f17745d1ce35782adaa79cb3312f9e3e5b57ef67c24"],"source_ids":["src_0656200055b95265931bfe038a70db9b"],"text":"ChatDev 1.0, the legacy 'Virtual Software Company' with CEO/CTO/Programmer-style agents automating the software lifecycle, has been moved to the chatdev1.0 branch for maintenance.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:26:10Z","updated_by_operation":"op_42f8b51d9c4943029c62e10d087e8171"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:26:10Z","created_by_operation":"op_42f8b51d9c4943029c62e10d087e8171","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_d4261314489e9628f0af62079f341f006bc760f9e1c3aad9245c98fb517d401c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=specifications","setting":"openbmb/chatdev@4fb2db0ea903 snapshot 73ccffc33d7b49cd","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_14cb47c8569e963645a1b12f12b0b4a0ee4c46dc2c2a47d1ae180d5b9bce36dc","slc_d48ce7a4b43d97cbb814a4096d8e8aa1974c566dca22d1e74d5a805ea1ac8ec8"],"source_ids":["src_0656200055b95265931bfe038a70db9b"],"text":"ChatDev 2.0 (DevAll) is described as a zero-code multi-agent platform where users define agents, workflows, and tasks via configuration for scenarios such as data visualization, 3D generation, and deep research.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:26:10Z","updated_by_operation":"op_42f8b51d9c4943029c62e10d087e8171"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:26:10Z","created_by_operation":"op_42f8b51d9c4943029c62e10d087e8171","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_d7537b2c88ec5bfdb16c8b73c39c243c7eb6238b84151fa60e4b0e0b31c1a060","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"openbmb/chatdev@4fb2db0ea903 snapshot 73ccffc33d7b49cd","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_fe1394e38520b70a496946041e484efdcc1f482934751b7a751b9d963d40660a"],"source_ids":["src_daa8306a64875810a02f47980fdc9366"],"text":"The memory system offers four built-in store types: simple (FAISS plus semantic rerank, read/write), file (read-only vector index over documents), blackboard (append-only recency log), and mem0 (cloud-managed, requires the mem0ai package).","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:26:10Z","updated_by_operation":"op_42f8b51d9c4943029c62e10d087e8171"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:26:10Z","created_by_operation":"op_42f8b51d9c4943029c62e10d087e8171","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_f1d65bd27a4a9c5932319a3e835f4db76905fef863fc658bb5f45857d7295953","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"openbmb/chatdev@4fb2db0ea903 snapshot 73ccffc33d7b49cd","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_103bff8cd5ed5d8a2dd8a20f7dcfb01486fd6e9f2ab6457389c93b49cb80fd42","slc_1f54830903602732edccece00040cc282c69e14ebd2930bbc6a7edbae1850cd3","slc_843b2d113a47686ded23f277b35ccc6d4ad57023df1dba59cbab2e271a0cf699","slc_903d22eb75b1e8ac4593b14c3456360f7377566978fdd1c15c9ab003c33f0b9b"],"source_ids":["src_0656200055b95265931bfe038a70db9b"],"text":"Alternatively the whole application runs via Docker Compose (docker compose up --build) with backend on port 6400 and frontend on 5173; services auto-restart on crash and local file changes are reflected in containers.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:26:10Z","updated_by_operation":"op_42f8b51d9c4943029c62e10d087e8171"}
